{
  "id": "RAW_0a0509920b",
  "title": "Agent Plan「Agent 云电脑」工具：让 AI 在云电脑上完成股市深度研究",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247522149&idx=1&sn=383a089a1ed8658ac6742851ca4d4325",
  "date": "2026-09-07 19:00:00",
  "author": "字节跳动技术团队",
  "siteName": "字节跳动技术团队",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>Agent&nbsp;Plan</span> <span>2026-09-07 19:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_c8aabff.jpeg\"></p>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">\n   <div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">引言</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">你有没有过这样的经历：接到一个深度调研任务，要查行情、翻研报、对数据、写分析，一坐就是大半天，浏览器开了十几个标签页，还得反复切换整理？</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果能把这些活儿 \"丢给云端\"，让一台 24 小时在线的云电脑自己拆解任务、检索资料、生成报告，而你只需要最后验收结果 ，将显著提升工作效率。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">今天这篇文章，就来聊聊火山方舟 Agent Plan 里专属 Harness工具「Agent 云电脑」。它不只是一个远程桌面，而是一个自带 agent loop、能自行拆解并执行复杂任务的云端助手。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">核心亮点：</span></strong></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">跨网页与桌面操作：</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;CUA 可以在云桌面中打开网页、使用站内搜索、滚动页面、切换标签页，并处理需要交互的页面。它适合多步 GUI 工作流，不局限于返回搜索摘要。</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">一次委派，持续观察：</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">只创建一次任务，云平台可自动拆解并执行复杂任务。平台可持续监控任务进度，监控任务中断不影响任务执行，可以随时停止和恢复任务监控。</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">长程复杂任务自行拆解：</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;对于复杂任务，云电脑agent可以自行拆解，充分利用云电脑预装的软件和交互方案，完成复杂任务。</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我们以 \"做一份股市大盘深度研究\" 为例演示「Agent 云电脑」能力，把复杂调研交给云端，真的可以很简单。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">前置准备</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">购买套餐：请登陆「火山方舟」或 「官网活动页」，购买Agent Plan套餐</span></strong></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">1. 购买Agent Plan套餐</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">进入 Agent Plan 控制台 购买 Agent Plan 套餐。购买后即可开启使用套餐内专属Harness工具。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);text-align: justify;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">注意：目前Agent 云电脑（Computer Use Agent）当前仅支持在&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Large/Max套餐</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;下使用。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6083333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038470\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_9ebc3d0.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">2. 安装并配置skill</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Agent 云电脑只使用 Agent Plan 凭证。推荐先用&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 107, 184);background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">arkcli</span></span><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;安装和配置 skill。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">使用 arkcli 安装和配置（推荐）。</span></strong></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">安装 arkcli</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ol>\n   <p class=\"code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js\"></p>\n   <ul class=\"code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js\"></ul>\n   <pre class=\"code-snippet__js\" data-lang=\"css\"><code><span leaf=\"\">npm&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__selector-tag\">i</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__keyword\">@volcengine</span>/ark-cli -g --registry&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__attribute\">https</span>://registry.npmjs.org</span></code></pre>\n   <p></p>\n   <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" start=\"2\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">通过 arkcli 配置 agentplan 并安装 cua，其中 profile 选择 agent plan</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ol>\n   <p class=\"code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js\"></p>\n   <ul class=\"code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js\"></ul>\n   <pre class=\"code-snippet__js\" data-lang=\"css\"><code><span leaf=\"\">arkcli helper mcp codex&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__attr\">--capability</span>&nbsp;cua</span></code></pre>\n   <p></p>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在 codex 中确认是否已经安装完毕</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.2050420168067226\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1190\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038481\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_5bdb53f.jpeg\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">详细操作指南</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Step1 &nbsp;通过 skill 来发起任务</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Agent 云电脑是一个开箱即用的一个 skill，初次登录时，服务端会给用户分配一个云电脑，后续用户使用同一个 api key 登录时，会复用之前的云电脑机器，因此你可以随时启用云电脑而不必担心配置和安装的软件丢失。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Agent 云电脑自带 agent loop，因此可以不必像传统的 computer use 工具一样，只暴露基础的操作接口，agent需要频繁和云桌面操作，而只需要下达指令即可，Agent 云电脑可以自行拆解复杂任务，并自己驱动执行。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9049295774647887\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1704\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038483\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_367ef41.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Step2 &nbsp;等待任务执行完成</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">云电脑的 agent 会自动解析和拆解任务，并且触发云端安装的软件和工具进行资料检索。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8621134020618557\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1552\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038480\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_d44eb66.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">完成资料整理和分析，生成有深度的分析。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 60%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.878748370273794\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1534\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038482\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_3811d61.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 40%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 95%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.393899204244032\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1508\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038479\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_04776a5.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Step3 &nbsp;登录云电脑查看执行过程</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">可以通过 skill让agent 返回临时 URL 来访问 Agent 云电脑查看执行过程和执行产物。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.31203703703703706\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038474\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_db85ca3.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5681063122923588\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"3010\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100038484\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260907114458_1767d0e.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Step4 查询 AFP 用量消耗</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">用户可通过方舟控制台查询 Agent Plan 套餐 AFP 的实时用量，完成该深度研究预估消费 11.46 AFP，此外还会根据任务独立消耗 token，请注意用量消耗根据个人具体使用情况存在差异。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">详情可见 AFP 积分机制：</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">该 Demo 实现的预估 AFP 消耗明细如下：</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <div style=\"min-height: 40px;margin: 10px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"width: 100%;margin: 0px auto -10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n    <table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;box-sizing: border-box;margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n     <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <td data-colwidth=\"20.0000%\" width=\"20.0000%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: center;padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">消耗项</span></strong></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n       <td data-colwidth=\"60.0100%\" width=\"60.0100%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: center;padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">消耗量</span></strong></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n       <td data-colwidth=\"20.0000%\" width=\"20.0000%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: center;padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">预估 AFP消耗</span></strong></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <td data-colwidth=\"20.0000%\" width=\"20.0000%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: center;padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">机器占用</span></strong></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n       <td data-colwidth=\"60.0100%\" width=\"60.0100%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次任务耗时11分钟，按照实际占用机器时长折算</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n       <td data-colwidth=\"20.0000%\" width=\"20.0000%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">11.46 AFP</span></span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <td data-colwidth=\"20.0000%\" width=\"20.0000%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: center;padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Token 消耗</span></strong></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n       <td data-colwidth=\"60.0100%\" width=\"60.0100%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次任务使用 Deepseek V4 pro 作为 CUA agent，输入消耗1221.3K，输出消耗29.7K</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n       <td data-colwidth=\"20.0000%\" width=\"20.0000%\" style=\"border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);border-style: solid;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin: 5px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 0px 5px;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">688.050 AFP</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </td>\n      </tr>\n     </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">结尾</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">当然，Agent 云电脑的能力远不止做股市研究 —— 行业调研、竞品分析、资料汇总、数据采集…… 凡是需要多步检索和整理的复杂任务，都可以交给它来跑。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">目前「Agent 云电脑」已在 Agent Plan 的 Large/Max 套餐开放，如果你手头正好有 \"必须开浏览器、来回切换窗口才能完成\" 的任务，不妨去尝试一次</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"字节跳动技术团队\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5EcwYhllQOhkoWTP1gVm0Lqs480XOARyoSYjPEsRVCSF35cbWIp6cliaYic8KUfNfiaSjVnruzTQUTCA0lmv9vUmw/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"字节跳动的技术实践分享\" data-id=\"MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==\"></mp-common-profile></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "火山方舟 Agent Plan 推出「Agent 云电脑」工具，让 AI 在云端电脑上自行拆解并执行股市深度研究等多步 GUI 任务，用户只需下达指令并验收结果。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "火山方舟 Agent Plan 推出「Agent 云电脑」工具，让 AI 在云端电脑上自行拆解并执行股市深度研究等多步 GUI 任务，用户只需下达指令并验收结果。",
  "summary": "本文介绍火山方舟 Agent Plan 中的专属 Harness 工具「Agent 云电脑」。该工具并非传统远程桌面，而是自带 agent loop 的云端助手，可让 CUA 在云桌面中打开网页、使用站内搜索、滚动页面、切换标签页，处理需要交互的多步 GUI 工作流。用户只需创建一次任务，云平台即可自动拆解并执行复杂任务，且任务监控中断不影响执行，可随时停止和恢复。文章以「做一份股市大盘深度研究」为例，演示了购买 Agent Plan 套餐、通过 arkcli 安装配置 skill、发起任务、等待执行完成、登录云电脑查看执行过程、查询 AFP 用量消耗等完整操作流程。该工具目前仅在 Agent Plan 的 Large/Max 套餐开放，完成示例中的深度研究预估消费 11.46 AFP（机器占用），另按任务独立消耗 token。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Agent 云电脑是自带 agent loop 的云端助手，而非传统远程桌面",
      "explanation": "它不暴露基础操作接口让 agent 频繁与云桌面交互，而是让用户直接下达指令，由云电脑自行拆解复杂任务并驱动执行，适合多步 GUI 工作流。"
    },
    {
      "point": "一次委派即可完成长程复杂任务，且监控中断不影响执行",
      "explanation": "平台可持续监控任务进度，用户可以随时停止和恢复任务监控，任务本身在云端继续运行，解决了传统人工盯守多步操作的低效问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Agent 云电脑支持跨网页与桌面操作",
      "explanation": "CUA 可以在云桌面中打开网页、使用站内搜索、滚动页面、切换标签页，并处理需要交互的页面，不局限于返回搜索摘要，适合需要多步检索和整理的复杂任务。"
    },
    {
      "point": "云电脑实例可复用，预装软件不丢失",
      "explanation": "初次登录时服务端分配云电脑，后续使用同一 api key 登录会复用之前的机器，用户不必担心配置和安装的软件丢失，可随时启用。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "它不只是一个远程桌面，而是一个自带 agent loop、能自行拆解并执行复杂任务的云端助手。",
    "只创建一次任务，云平台可自动拆解并执行复杂任务。平台可持续监控任务进度，监控任务中断不影响任务执行，可以随时停止和恢复任务监控。",
    "Agent 云电脑自带 agent loop，因此可以不必像传统的 computer use 工具一样，只暴露基础的操作接口，agent 需要频繁和云桌面操作，而只需要下达指令即可，Agent 云电脑可以自行拆解复杂任务，并自己驱动执行。"
